nts, Soup","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"American (New), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Vegetarian","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"American (New), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"N1we1YLrBxPOoenxJwzdOA","review_id":"IIAHVCvm22iNHgDFO7iiww","date":"2019-10-24T00:16:07","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9326657652854919,"text_excerpt":"I had lunch at Max Well on Magazine today. The Banh Mi bowl was nice, the tofu was marinated and seasoned very well. Maybe the best tofu I've ever had. The brown rice that was a part of the bowl was very tasty, it had a nice nutty toasted flavor. I wasn't a fan of the lentils and kale that were apart of the bowl because they were a tad hard and difficult to eat. The pickled veggies were nice but there could have been more to give that bright acid component you experience with a Banh Mi. The sriracha dressing it came with was nice but muted the bright pickled flavors. All in all I did enjoy the food there. The carrot soup tasted fresh and tasted like I took a bite out of a delicious fresh ..."},{"business_id":"N1we1YLrBxPOoenxJwzdOA","review_id":"8st5est9jnktBEI9cTtXuw","date":"2021-07-11T19:12:35","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9234364032745361,"text_excerpt":"First time at Max Well's. Went with a vegetarian friend and it was excellent. I loved to beet/apple, etc juice. This is a great option for New Orleans and close to home for me. Thanks. I'll be back to try the lasagna!"},{"business_id":"N1we1YLrBxPOoenxJwzdOA","review_id":"162HyHgzqGAykHYUip5kEQ","date":"2019-12-27T20:49:24","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9195656776428223,"text_excerpt":"I'm not a vegan, but you don't need to be to enjoy the heck out of the Max Well menu. Whether you want to go meat free, have a meal chock full of healthy goods or just have a delicious bite, Max Well is for all. My personal favorite is the savory sweet potato lasagna. Who knew cashew cream could be so good and thin slices of sweet potato with ground nuts between, I certainly wasn't missing anything. It comes with an action packed salad too. Enough for two meals! They have a great selection of fresh squeezed juices, bowls of goodness and an amazing avocado remoulade thingy that I crave. It's filling without draining you of energy. Highly recommend stopping in!!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"N1we1YLrBxPOoenxJwzdOA","photo_id":"Aag2tNbtsz7qwxNTZjxwcQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/Aag2tNbtsz7qwxNTZjxwcQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8453716039657593},{"business_id":"N1we1YLrBxPOoenxJwzdOA","photo_id":"VW91bkNySqK1Caxp6AhPwA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/VW91bkNySqK1Caxp6AhPwA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8395302295684814},{"business_id":"N1we1YLrBxPOoenxJwzdOA","photo_id":"o5M6H8MzXuAnf7BXCuLCVg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/o5M6H8MzXuAnf7BXCuLCVg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8212745785713196},{"business_id":"N1we1YLrBxPOoenxJwzdOA","photo_id":"JgAg02d0b2JtRHhGvv84vA","label"